- **Flask-CORS Version**: 6.0.2

## File Locations

- **Compiler Binary**: `C:\Users\ajade\Desktop\CC\project\src\compiler.exe`
- **Web Server**: `http://localhost:5000`
- **Flask App**: `C:\Users\ajade\Desktop\CC\project\web-gui\app.py`

## Notes

- Ensure `compiler.exe` exists in the src folder before running the web GUI
- The web GUI runs on `http://127.0.0.1:5000` (localhost)
- Use MSYS2 UCRT64 terminal for best compatibility on Windows
- Flask server should display debug information in terminal during execution

